Imagine you are exploring the ruins of an ancient civilization which
spoke Lojban. You might find something like this engraved on the
walls. My friend TheRomp, from the local Lojban group, has been
designing this alphabet over the last few years to match actual
factors in the position of the mouth.

http://www.nemorathwald.com/lojban/TheRomp-phonetic-alphabet.jpg

I've drawn it in vector art as you see here. But if you want any
explanations, you'll have to wait to catch TheRomp on the IRC channel,
since I didn't come up with it.

